    o	Add processes: 
          	1.1 User Management 
          	1.2 Course Management 
          	1.3 Quiz Management 
          	1.4 Progress Tracking 
          	1.5 Admin Management 
    o	Add data stores: 
          	D1 User Database 
          	D2 Course Database 
          	D3 Quiz Database 
          	D4 Progress Database 
